Cell["\<\
(* Since the first derivative of d\[CapitalNu]dt is greater than 0 when \
evaluated at the \[CapitalNu]=0 equilibrium this equilibrium is unstable. 
Similarly, since the first derivative of d\[CapitalNu]dt is less than 0 when \
evaluated at the \[CapitalNu]=K equilibrium this equilibrium is stable. *)\
\>", "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.591971265958127*^9, 3.591971297084652*^9}, {
